<strong>Solar Controller</strong>: CN3065 Mini Solar Charger IC + 5V 5W Monocrystalline Panel<br />
<strong>Voltage Regulator</strong>: HT7333-1 LDO (3.3V Output, Ultra-Low Quiescent Current $I_q &lt; 4\mu\text{A}$)  </p>
